345 0 obj
<< /Alt (A flowchart for booking. Open the site leads to Find a time. Changing a filter leads to the decision Any times match. No leads to the decision Why not, which branches to three empty states: day not open yet for this group size, every time is booked, and past the last tee time. Each offers suggestions that loop back. Yes leads to the list of tee times, then picking a time leads to the decision Signed in. No leads to Sign in, with a loop for a wrong password. Both reach Review and pay, which can loop to update the total, go back to the list, or Pay. Processing branches to Confirmed, an alert that the time was taken which returns to the list, or an alert that the connection dropped which retries. Confirmed links to Flow 2 or back to Find a time.) /K 1 /P 72 0 R /Pg 23 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
346 0 obj
<< /K [ 685 0 R 130 0 R 689 0 R ] /P 72 0 R /S /Caption /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
347 0 obj
<< /Alt (A flowchart for cancelling. Two starts, Main nav My tee times and Confirmed page or confirmation email link, lead to the decision Signed in, with Sign in on the no path. Both reach My tee times, where each tee time says what you would get back now. Past tee times expands the list. Cancel on one tee time leads to the Cancel screen with the policy table and current tier marked. From there, Compare both courses goes to the rules page, Keep my tee time goes back, and Cancel and get leads to Cancelling. Cancelling branches to Cancelled, an alert that the amount changed which asks again, or an alert that the connection dropped which retries. Cancelled links back to My tee times or to Flow 1.) /K 1 /P 73 0 R /Pg 24 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
